[PLAN] feat.opt.regions: 
Regions (docs/design/graph-store 3.3): a column of the region a node is in and a table of the
regions of a graph, kept by decode, encode, commit and the chunks. `test::regions` puts nodes of
a program's largest graph in two nested regions and commits; the new version has them, a decode
and a second commit with no change in between give the same version, and the program runs as
before (no back end reads regions yet).

